title Choose a font set for a look in its card and leave the card with Esc: the card said beforehand that Esc keeps the change, and the saved draft holds the font set.
waits-for CF1 item 6: Esc saves the look, and the screen does not say so

file etc/vtium.conf
    version = 1
    font-name = unifont
    [look plain]
    palette = legacy
    [head console]
    vt = 5
    look = plain
file etc/batch.conf
    ROOT/fonts/mono.bdf
font fonts/mono.bdf 8x16
frit mono
    source=bdf:ROOT/fonts/mono.bdf

# The Looks tab: Enter opens the look plain's card, and its Font set
# line's choices; Down and Enter pick mono.
press 3 Enter Down Enter
at the font set's choices
press Down Enter
at the card, before Esc
check screen shows "Esc keeps the changes"
check screen lacks "Esc back"
press Esc s
at the save
check draft look plain font-name mono
